 Is You</strong>, <strong>A Monster's Expedition</strong>, <strong>The Witness</strong>, <strong>The Talos Principle</strong>, and <strong>Tunic</strong>.", "short_description": "Investigate the Pyramid of Charaon, a giant puzzle where every room can be rotated to open new paths. Solve challenging puzzles, uncover well-hidden secrets, and slowly piece together the truth behind this forgotten place.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Italian, German, Dutch, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/fcc4185b69fb0f2ade28083f96d9bfaf55b8b57c/header.jpg?t=1780216710", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/93659af2d7ecceb59bbd2e0744491d0ec6c933ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780216710", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/93659af2d7ecceb59bbd2e0744491d0ec6c933ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780216710", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86, x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> (We believe this can work on a toaster)</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "developers": ["Righteous Tree"], "publishers": ["Righteous Tree"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1299, "final": 1299, "discou